Package: miniforge3
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: coplo <dayearnew@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/conda-forge/miniforge
Depends: libc6
Description: Minimal conda-forge distribution
 Miniforge provides conda and mamba with conda-forge configured as the
 default package channel. The system-managed base environment is installed
 under /opt/miniforge3.
